WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:01,580
what did you say

2
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:03,060
If Gu Shiyi was Gu Zangsheng

3
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:04,900
Then isn't he the younger brother who bites the elder?

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,470
what did you say

5
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:09,280
Say it again, Brother Gu

6
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:10,400
Gu Shiyi

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,560
It's Gu Zangsheng again, then why?

8
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:15,080
Then why does Brother Gu only have five fingers?

9
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,180
one day nine years ago

10
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:20,090
He suddenly came back crying

11
00:00:20,090 --> 00:00:22,690
He roared and swore that he would take back everything he had

12
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:23,690
nine years ago

13
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:25,940
It was the day when the Gu family admitted that it was a fake.

14
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,100
After taking the oath

15
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,620
Brother Gu suddenly bit off his finger

16
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:29,820
Swallowed into the stomach

17
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:31,020
I'm scared

18
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,260
Ask him why

19
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:33,870
he cried and said

20
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:35,670
Want to take everything back

21
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:36,670
you must accept it first

22
00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:39,070
He has lost all the facts

23
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:40,510
from that moment on

24
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:42,390
He is no longer Gu Zangsheng

25
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:46,510
He is just Gu Shiyi Zangsheng

26
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:47,750
my brother
